  "validation_rules": [
    "A female cannot be represented as split for a standard Z-linked recessive mutation.",
    "Alleles belonging to the same locus cannot be selected as independent Boolean genes.",
    "Texas Clearbody and Ino are alleles at the same Z-linked locus.",
    "Lacewing is a compound phenotype, not an independent mutation locus.",
    "Clearwing and Greywing belong to the same dilution locus in this model.",
    "Phenotype and genotype must be stored separately.",
    "Masked traits remain genetically present.",
    "Rare/experimental mutations must be disable-able.",
    "Polygenic/uncertain traits must not be forced into Mendelian probability calculations without an explicit approximation mode."
  ],
